OL,12,G0500 Film Noir
OL,13,     FClassic Noir. 2022. The 1940s and
OL,14,     F50s were the heyday of Film Noir.
OL,15,     FThis new style which had developed
OL,16,     Ffrom the days of silent film and
OL,17,     FGerman Expressionism was now
OL,18,     Freaching its peak in Hollywood.
